      "ibSubject": "global-politics",
      "maps": {},
      "unmapped": "Global Politics has no fixed Danish equivalence, and that is the Agency's own position rather than a gap in our data. It goes far deeper into international politics than Danish Social Studies A but omits the sociology and economics the Danish subject covers. Aarhus accepts Global Politics HL as Social Studies B, and Global Politics SL together with Economics SL or HL; CBS accepts it at SL or HL; Copenhagen has accepted Global Politics HL. Elsewhere, write to the admissions office before 15 March and ask for a written assessment."
